@HardeepAsrani the issue is fixed in the latest version of Otter.

It was indeed a problem with the previous version. Don't exactly know why but when OrbitFox tried to execute "wp_kses" function from here https://github.com/Codeinwp/themeisle-companion/blob/master/obfx_modules/policy-notice/init.php#L202, everything was so slow. After deactivating Otter 1.7.5, everything was fine.

Now I updated Otter to 2.0 and everything works great!
